TITLE="Frontend Developer"
DESC="Frontend Developer agent you start and stop. Input: task breakdown, feature list + acceptance criteria, high-fidelity designs, design system, interaction specs, visual assets, API contracts, technical standards, implementation guidelines + review checklist, event instrumentation spec, bug reports, security findings. Output: frontend pull requests with code plus unit, component and integration tests. Grows a frontend skill from every feature."
